      "content": "hey can u help me out? im writing a script for this new podcast idea. the host is this guy named Joe, he's just a regular working class guy from a small town, super \"common sense\" type of dude. he's got this whole vibe where he just calls out the elites and the people in DC who don't care about real people. can u write a short 1-minute intro for his first episode? just to get the tone right.",
